{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"edits\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-2\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"可这么盼着，他说不清当初走得对不对、自己后不后悔，也想不出没走会怎样，怕回去又得忍让。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S10-1\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"他慢慢觉得自己最舍不得的，还是从前有人把他当作自己人的日子；一想起那份亲近，心里又暖又酸。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"note\": \"本轮只改两条。S04-2的意见成立：g56和g6都指出这一段过多回到离开决定是否正确的问题。修改保留了当初走得对不对、自己究竟后不后悔、如果没走会怎样三个独立念头，同时把对亲近生活的盼望与害怕重新忍让的顾虑放在一起，没有丢掉守护清单要求的心理层次。S10-1的意见也成立：两位读者都指出后半段部分内容过度围绕是否回去打转，因此把原来的回去以后能否恢复从前的追问，改为想起归属时同时感到温暖和酸楚。这样S10-1写怀念中的复杂感受，S10-2保留受过的气不能抹掉、不能只凭舍不得放心回去的理由，S11继续承担明确选择的作用。S11不改，因为S11-2已经清楚表达不愿为一点希望重新过忍让的日子，S11-3保留先把眼下日子过稳的打算，S11-4保留害怕仍在却不收回打算的主动性；这些是人物坚持尊严的具体表现，不宜当作重复的去留判断删改。S01-S02的空落与怀念、S13对未来亲近关系出现时间的担忧，均只有g6单独提出，未得到第二位读者的共同支持，依照本轮规则不改。其余条目全部保持原样。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "590a07ac-d570-4a92-bd3b-a2b46e14bf97", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T101115358034Z", "elapsed_seconds": 138.234, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T10:13:33.607967+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d084b9ea5618b95632a8af3e90a26401cb1fa0fd58a9fc206ced4676bb6d096c", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T101115358034Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "2be72cc8c2788d5a7e94c0f53790ab1274dcbd7ae15aeeb3cee0daa41e6d8f01"}}}
